ngine/godot/issues/106769","id":2907684738,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tT7-C","user":{"login":"zimonitrome","id":17656709,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NjU2NzA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17656709?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zimonitrome","html_url":"https://github.com/zimonitrome","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zimonitrome/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zimonitrome/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zimonitrome/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zimonitrome/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zimonitrome/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zimonitrome/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zimonitrome/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zimonitrome/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zimonitrome/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-25T08:17:50Z","updated_at":"2025-05-26T09:09:14Z","body":"It's an issue if you want to center a label properly. Even setting horizontal alignment to center will not work since the font word has asymmetrical spacing. But I realize that most system fonts even out their spacing around each glyph such that it has equal spacing both left and right. I guess most bitmap font creators just aren't doing it?\n\nHere I've evened out the spacing in the bitmap font:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6a8a65ac-a2d1-4e75-b156-e80127f1b3eb)\n\nAnd for comparison I also put a system font which seems to do the exact same thing.\n\nNot sure why I was under the impression that glyph advance should not be used. It might be more obvious when using tiny fonts like these. But yes it's not an issue with Godot. But it is a bit unsatisfying that fonts don't immediately start and end with the first and last glyph but rather spacing just in general.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2907684738/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]